    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of everything else\"... what does that even mean? i feel like i've already given every piece of myself to this job. there's nothing left to give. if i just stopped, the machine would keep running without me, and honestly, i think that's the only way the noise would actually stop. the silence sounds so much better than this.",
